@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam titleBorderColor #000000
skinparam titleBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam titleBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontStyle bold

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowThickness 1.2
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #000000
    BoxBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    GroupBorderColor #000000
    GroupHeaderFontColor #000000
    GroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DividerBorderColor #000000
    DividerBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    DividerFontColor #000000
    DividerFontSize 12
    DividerFontStyle bold
}

title Sequence Diagram: Mendengarkan Perbandingan Audio Mentah vs Audio Perbaikan (UC-16)

actor "Audio Engineer" as User

box "Presentation Layer (Frontend)"
boundary "Pemutar Multitrack A/B\n(Web UI Player)" as UI
control "WebAudioEngine\n(Dual-Buffer AudioContext)" as AudioEngine
control "PhaseMeterRenderer\n(Canvas Visualizer)" as Visualizer
end box

box "Application & Business Logic Layer (Backend API)"
control "PlaybackController\n(API Gateway)" as PlayCtrl
control "AuthMiddleware\n(JWT Guard)" as AuthGuard
entity "PlaybackSessionService\n(Stem Manifest Service)" as PlaySvc
end box

box "External Storage / Infrastructure"
control "Cloud Object Storage / CDN\n(S3 / Signed Dual-Stems)" as Storage
end box

box "Persistence Layer"
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
end box

autonumber 1 "[00]"

== Fase 1: Inisialisasi & Pemuatan Dual-Stem Buffer (Raw vs Fixed) ==

User -> UI : Buka antarmuka Pemutar Multitrack A/B (dari UC-14/UC-15)
activate User
activate UI

UI -> PlayCtrl : GET /api/v1/sessions/{id}/playback-manifest (Bearer JWT)
activate PlayCtrl

PlayCtrl -> AuthGuard : validateSession(token)
activate AuthGuard
AuthGuard --> PlayCtrl : SessionValid (user_id)
deactivate AuthGuard

PlayCtrl -> PlaySvc : getDualPlaybackManifest(session_id)
activate PlaySvc

PlaySvc -> DB : SELECT id, name, raw_stem_url, repaired_stem_url, phase_data FROM session_tracks WHERE session_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> PlaySvc : Metadata trek & presigned URL audio mentah vs perbaikan
deactivate DB

PlaySvc --> PlayCtrl : PlaybackManifestPayload (tracks[], session_id, duration)
deactivate PlaySvc

PlayCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (manifest, dual_stem_urls)
deactivate PlayCtrl

UI -> AudioEngine : initAudioContext(sample_rate=48kHz, channels=2)
activate AudioEngine

AudioEngine -> Storage : Fetch stem audio (Dual-Stream parallel: raw & repaired chunks)
activate Storage
Storage --> AudioEngine : Binary Audio Buffers (WAV / PCM Float32Array)
deactivate Storage

AudioEngine -> AudioEngine : Decode audio buffers & sinkronisasi timecode (start_time = 0.0s)
AudioEngine --> UI : AudioBuffersReady (Dual-buffer synced)
deactivate AudioEngine

UI --> User : Render pemutar multitrack penuh (garis waktu, tombol A/B, Mono Check, Meter Fasa)
deactivate UI

== Fase 2: Pemutaran Multitrack Sinkron & Monitoring Real-Time ==

User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Play" (Spasi)
activate UI

UI -> AudioEngine : playAllTracks(startTime=currentTime, mode='FIXED')
activate AudioEngine

AudioEngine -> AudioEngine : Mulai pemutaran seluruh trek serentak via WebAudio nodes
AudioEngine -> Visualizer : Kirim audio frame data ke AnalyserNode
activate Visualizer

Visualizer -> Visualizer : Hitung real-time phase correlation (-1.0 s/d +1.0) & VU metering
Visualizer --> UI : Render grafik korelasi fasa & meter level dinamis (60 FPS)
deactivate Visualizer

UI --> User : Tampilan visualizer bergerak sinkron & audio perbaikan mengalun di monitor
deactivate UI
deactivate AudioEngine

== Fase 3: Pengujian Komparasi A/B & Pemeriksaan Mono (Typical Course) ==

User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Komparasi A/B" (Raw vs Repaired)
activate UI

UI -> AudioEngine : switchAudioSource(target='RAW', crossfadeMs=5)
activate AudioEngine

AudioEngine -> AudioEngine : Alihkan output ke Raw Audio Buffers pada timecode identik tanpa latensi/klik
AudioEngine -> Visualizer : Alihkan sinyal input AnalyserNode ke trek mentah
activate Visualizer

Visualizer --> UI : Perbarui grafik korelasi fasa (tampilkan fasa terbalik / indikasi merah)
deactivate Visualizer

UI --> User : Terdengar audio mentah sebelum perbaikan & meter fasa berkedip merah (-1.0)
deactivate AudioEngine
deactivate UI

User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Komparasi A/B" kembali ke audio hasil perbaikan
activate UI

UI -> AudioEngine : switchAudioSource(target='FIXED', crossfadeMs=5)
activate AudioEngine

AudioEngine -> AudioEngine : Alihkan output ke Repaired Audio Buffers tanpa jeda waktu
AudioEngine -> Visualizer : Alihkan sinyal input AnalyserNode ke trek perbaikan
activate Visualizer

Visualizer --> UI : Perbarui grafik korelasi fasa (tampilkan fasa koheren / indikasi hijau)
deactivate Visualizer

UI --> User : Terdengar audio bersih koheren & meter fasa kembali hijau (+0.8 s/d +1.0)
deactivate AudioEngine
deactivate UI

User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Mono Check"
activate UI

UI -> AudioEngine : toggleMonoSumming(enabled=true)
activate AudioEngine

AudioEngine -> AudioEngine : Gabungkan channel Left & Right ke mono summing bus (L+R / 2)
AudioEngine -> Visualizer : Kirim sinyal mono sum ke AnalyserNode
activate Visualizer

Visualizer --> UI : Perbarui visualizer mono correlation & kekuatan sinyal tengah (Mid/Side)
deactivate Visualizer

AudioEngine --> UI : MonoModeActive
deactivate AudioEngine

UI --> User : Audio beralih ke mono tanpa phase cancellation (vokal & drum tetap terdengar solid)
deactivate UI

== Fase 4: Fitur Penyetelan Lanjutan (Alternative Workflow) ==

alt [Alternative Workflow 1: Solo atau Mute Trek Tertentu]
  User -> UI : Tekan tombol Solo (S) pada Snare / Mute (M) pada Overhead
  activate UI
  UI -> AudioEngine : setTrackGain(track_id='snare', solo=true, mute=false)
  activate AudioEngine
  AudioEngine -> AudioEngine : Redam gain trek non-solo menjadi 0, isolasi output trek terpilih
  AudioEngine --> UI : TrackStateUpdated
  deactivate AudioEngine
  UI --> User : Audisi instrumen spesifik secara mendalam tanpa distraksi instrumen lain
  deactivate UI

else [Alternative Workflow 2: Melakukan Perulangan (Loop Region)]
  User -> UI : Seleksi rentang loop region pada garis waktu lagu (misal: Bar 16 - 24)
  activate UI
  UI -> AudioEngine : setLoopRange(startTime=32.0s, endTime=48.0s, loop=true)
  activate AudioEngine
  AudioEngine -> AudioEngine : Konfigurasi AudioBufferSourceNode loop endpoints
  AudioEngine --> UI : LoopRegionActivated
  deactivate AudioEngine
  UI --> User : Audio berputar berulang otomatis pada segmen yang dipilih untuk evaluasi detail
  deactivate UI
end

== Fase 5: Penanganan Beban Kinerja / Glitch Audio (Exceptional Workflow) ==

opt [Exceptional Workflow: Beban CPU/Memori Pengguna Tinggi (Audio Glitch / Drop-out Warning)]
  activate AudioEngine
  AudioEngine -> AudioEngine : Deteksi lonjakan latensi AudioContext / buffer underrun
  AudioEngine -> UI : emitPerformanceWarning(dropFrameDetected=true)
  deactivate AudioEngine
  activate UI
  UI -> Visualizer : throttleRendering(targetFps=15, simplifyGraph=true)
  activate Visualizer
  Visualizer --> UI : VisualizerThrottled
  deactivate Visualizer
  UI --> User : Turunkan animasi visualizer sementara & tampilkan toast: "Mengoptimalkan performa pemutaran"
  deactivate UI
end

== Fase 6: Validasi Selesai & Navigasi ke Unduhan ==

User -> UI : Tekan tombol "Selesai & Lanjut ke Unduhan"
activate UI

UI -> PlayCtrl : POST /api/v1/sessions/{id}/verify-audit (Bearer JWT)
activate PlayCtrl

PlayCtrl -> PlaySvc : markSessionVerified(session_id)
activate PlaySvc

PlaySvc -> DB : UPDATE sessions SET status = 'AUDIT_VERIFIED', verified_at = NOW() WHERE id = session_id
activate DB
DB --> PlaySvc : StatusUpdated
deactivate DB

PlaySvc --> PlayCtrl : SessionVerificationSuccess
deactivate PlaySvc

PlayCtrl --> UI : 200 OK (redirect_url='/sessions/{id}/export')
deactivate PlayCtrl

UI --> User : Alihkan ke halaman pengunduhan paket stem (UC-17) & laporan audit PDF (UC-18)
deactivate UI

deactivate User

@enduml
